  11:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_bus.h ****       A delay between an RCC peripheral clock enable and the effective peripheral
  12:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_bus.h ****       enabling should be taken into account in order to manage the peripheral read/write
  13:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_bus.h ****       from/to registers.
  14:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_bus.h ****       (+) This delay depends on the peripheral mapping.
  15:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_bus.h ****         (++) AHB & APB peripherals, 1 dummy read is necessary
  16:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_bus.h **** 
  17:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_bus.h ****     [..]
  18:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_bus.h ****       Workarounds:
  19:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_bus.h ****       (#) For AHB & APB peripherals, a dummy read to the peripheral register has been
  20:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_bus.h ****           inserted in each LL_{BUS}_GRP{x}_EnableClock() function.
