1476:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Helper macro to set the value of ADC analog watchdog threshold high
1477:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         or low in function of ADC resolution, when ADC resolution is
1478:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         different of 12 bits.
1479:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   To be used with function @ref LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDThresholds().
1480:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Example, with a ADC resolution of 8 bits, to set the value of
1481:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         analog watchdog threshold high (on 8 bits):
