1749:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Helper macro to calculate the temperature (unit: degree Celsius)
1750:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         from ADC conversion data of internal temperature sensor.
1751:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Computation is using temperature sensor typical values
1752:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (refer to device datasheet).
1753:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Calculation formula:
1754:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           Temperature = (TS_TYP_CALx_VOLT(uV) - TS_ADC_DATA * Conversion_uV)
