1756:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           with TS_ADC_DATA      = temperature sensor raw data measured by ADC
1757:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                                   (unit: digital value)
1758:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                Avg_Slope        = temperature sensor slope
1759:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                                   (unit: uV/Degree Celsius)
1760:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                TS_TYP_CALx_VOLT = temperature sensor digital value at
1761:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                                   temperature CALx_TEMP (unit: mV)
1762:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Caution: Calculation relevancy under reserve the temperature sensor
1763:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                  of the current device has characteristics in line with
1764:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                  datasheet typical values.
1765:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                  If temperature sensor calibration values are available on
1766:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                  on this device (presence of macro __LL_ADC_CALC_TEMPERATURE()),
1767:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                  temperature calculation will be more accurate using
1768:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                  helper macro @ref __LL_ADC_CALC_TEMPERATURE().
1769:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   As calculation input, the analog reference voltage (Vref+) must be
1770:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         defined as it impacts the ADC LSB equivalent voltage.
1771:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Analog reference voltage (Vref+) must be either known from
1772:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         user board environment or can be calculated using ADC measurement
1773:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         and ADC helper macro @ref __LL_ADC_CALC_VREFANALOG_VOLTAGE().
1774:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   ADC measurement data must correspond to a resolution of 12bits
1775:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (full scale digital value 4095). If not the case, the data must be
1776:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         preliminarily rescaled to an equivalent resolution of 12 bits.
