2304:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
2305:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Get ADC group regular sequencer length and scan direction.
2306:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Description of ADC group regular sequencer features:
2307:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - For devices with sequencer fully configurable
2308:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           (function "LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerRanks()" available):
2309:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           sequencer length and each rank affectation to a channel
2310:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           are configurable.
2311:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           This function retrieves:
2312:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - Sequence length: Number of ranks in the scan sequence.
2313:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - Sequence direction: Unless specified in parameters, sequencer
2314:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             scan direction is forward (from rank 1 to rank n).
2315:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           Sequencer ranks are selected using
2316:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           function "LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerRanks()".
2317:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - For devices with sequencer not fully configurable
2318:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           (function "LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerChannels()" available):
2319:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           sequencer length and each rank affectation to a channel
2320:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           are defined by channel number.
2321:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           This function retrieves:
2322:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - Sequence length: Number of ranks in the scan sequence is
2323:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             defined by number of channels set in the sequence,
2324:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             rank of each channel is fixed by channel HW number.
2325:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             (channel 0 fixed on rank 0, channel 1 fixed on rank1, ...).
2326:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - Sequence direction: Unless specified in parameters, sequencer
2327:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             scan direction is forward (from lowest channel number to
2328:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             highest channel number).
2329:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           Sequencer ranks are selected using
2330:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           function "LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerChannels()".
2331:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, group regular sequencer configuration
2332:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         is conditioned to ADC instance sequencer mode.
2333:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         If ADC instance sequencer mode is disabled, sequencers of
2334:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         all groups (group regular, group injected) can be configured
2335:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         but their execution is disabled (limited to rank 1).
2336:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Refer to function @ref LL_ADC_SetSequencersScanMode().
2337:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Sequencer disabled is equivalent to sequencer of 1 rank:
2338:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC conversion on only 1 channel.
2339:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @rmtoll SQR1     L              LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerLength
2340:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  ADCx ADC instance
2341:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @retval Returned value can be one of the following values:
2342:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_REG_SEQ_SCAN_DISABLE
2343:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_REG_SEQ_SCAN_ENABLE_2RANKS
2344:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_REG_SEQ_SCAN_ENABLE_3RANKS
2345:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_REG_SEQ_SCAN_ENABLE_4RANKS
2346:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_REG_SEQ_SCAN_ENABLE_5RANKS
