3093:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         updated after one ADC conversion trigger and with data
3094:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         permanently kept (not erased by successive conversions of scan of
3095:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC sequencer ranks), up to 5 data registers:
3096:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         1 data register on ADC group regular, 4 data registers
3097:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         on ADC group injected.
3098:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   If ADC group injected injected trigger source is set to an
3099:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         external trigger, this feature must be must be set to
3100:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         independent trigger.
3101:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC group injected automatic trigger is compliant only with
3102:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         group injected trigger source set to SW start, without any
3103:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         further action on  ADC group injected conversion start or stop:
3104:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         in this case, ADC group injected is controlled only
3105:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         from ADC group regular.
3106:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   It is not possible to enable both ADC group injected
