 552:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c **** /**
 553:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @brief  Initialize some features of ADC instance.
 554:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   These parameters have an impact on ADC scope: ADC instance.
 555:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         Affects both group regular and group injected (availability
 556:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         of ADC group injected depends on STM32 families).
 557:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         Refer to corresponding unitary functions into
 558:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         @ref ADC_LL_EF_Configuration_ADC_Instance .
 559:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   The setting of these parameters by function @ref LL_ADC_Init()
 560:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         is conditioned to ADC state:
 561:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         ADC instance must be disabled.
 562:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         This condition is applied to all ADC features, for efficiency
 563:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         and compatibility over all STM32 families. However, the different
 564:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         features can be set under different ADC state conditions
 565:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         (setting possible with ADC enabled without conversion on going,
 566:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         ADC enabled with conversion on going, ...)
 567:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         Each feature can be updated afterwards with a unitary function
 568:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         and potentially with ADC in a different state than disabled,
 569:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         refer to description of each function for setting
 570:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         conditioned to ADC state.
 571:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   After using this function, some other features must be configured
 572:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         using LL unitary functions.
 573:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         The minimum configuration remaining to be done is:
 574:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *          - Set ADC group regular or group injected sequencer:
 575:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *            map channel on the selected sequencer rank.
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Admin\AppData\Local\Temp\ccHarYQc.s 			page 120


 576:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *            Refer to function @ref LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerRanks().
 577:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *          - Set ADC channel sampling time
 578:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *            Refer to function LL_ADC_SetChannelSamplingTime();
 579:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @param  ADCx ADC instance
