 648:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c **** /**
 649:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @brief  Initialize some features of ADC group regular.
 650:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   These parameters have an impact on ADC scope: ADC group regular.
 651:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         Refer to corresponding unitary functions into
 652:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         @ref ADC_LL_EF_Configuration_ADC_Group_Regular
 653:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         (functions with prefix "REG").
 654:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   The setting of these parameters by function @ref LL_ADC_Init()
 655:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         is conditioned to ADC state:
 656:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         ADC instance must be disabled.
 657:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         This condition is applied to all ADC features, for efficiency
 658:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         and compatibility over all STM32 families. However, the different
 659:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         features can be set under different ADC state conditions
 660:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         (setting possible with ADC enabled without conversion on going,
 661:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         ADC enabled with conversion on going, ...)
 662:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         Each feature can be updated afterwards with a unitary function
 663:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         and potentially with ADC in a different state than disabled,
 664:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         refer to description of each function for setting
 665:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         conditioned to ADC state.
 666:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   After using this function, other features must be configured
 667:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         using LL unitary functions.
 668:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         The minimum configuration remaining to be done is:
 669:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *          - Set ADC group regular or group injected sequencer:
 670:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *            map channel on the selected sequencer rank.
 671:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *            Refer to function @ref LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerRanks().
 672:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *          - Set ADC channel sampling time
 673:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *            Refer to function LL_ADC_SetChannelSamplingTime();
 674:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @param  ADCx ADC instance
 675:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @param  ADC_REG_InitStruct Pointer to a @ref LL_ADC_REG_InitTypeDef structure
 676:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @retval An ErrorStatus enumeration value:
 677:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *          - SUCCESS: ADC registers are initialized
 678:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *          - ERROR: ADC registers are not initialized
 679:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   */
 680:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c **** ErrorStatus LL_ADC_REG_Init(ADC_TypeDef *ADCx, LL_ADC_REG_InitTypeDef *ADC_REG_InitStruct)
