 783:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c **** /**
 784:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @brief  Initialize some features of ADC group injected.
 785:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   These parameters have an impact on ADC scope: ADC group injected.
 786:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         Refer to corresponding unitary functions into
 787:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         @ref ADC_LL_EF_Configuration_ADC_Group_Regular
 788:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         (functions with prefix "INJ").
 789:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   The setting of these parameters by function @ref LL_ADC_Init()
 790:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         is conditioned to ADC state:
 791:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         ADC instance must be disabled.
 792:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         This condition is applied to all ADC features, for efficiency
 793:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         and compatibility over all STM32 families. However, the different
 794:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         features can be set under different ADC state conditions
 795:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         (setting possible with ADC enabled without conversion on going,
 796:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         ADC enabled with conversion on going, ...)
 797:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         Each feature can be updated afterwards with a unitary function
 798:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         and potentially with ADC in a different state than disabled,
 799:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         refer to description of each function for setting
 800:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         conditioned to ADC state.
 801:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @note   After using this function, other features must be configured
 802:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         using LL unitary functions.
 803:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *         The minimum configuration remaining to be done is:
 804:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *          - Set ADC group injected sequencer:
 805:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *            map channel on the selected sequencer rank.
 806:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *            Refer to function @ref LL_ADC_INJ_SetSequencerRanks().
 807:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *          - Set ADC channel sampling time
 808:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *            Refer to function LL_ADC_SetChannelSamplingTime();
 809:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @param  ADCx ADC instance
 810:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @param  ADC_INJ_InitStruct Pointer to a @ref LL_ADC_INJ_InitTypeDef structure
 811:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   * @retval An ErrorStatus enumeration value:
 812:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *          - SUCCESS: ADC registers are initialized
 813:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   *          - ERROR: ADC registers are not initialized
 814:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_ll_adc.c ****   */
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Admin\AppData\Local\Temp\ccHarYQc.s 			page 129


